{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51330","headline":"梅花吟 · 李愬","name":"梅花吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平淮策骑过东来，适遇梅花灼烁开。\n相耐岁寒存苦节，故於冷境发枯荄。\n（《弘治黄州府志》七《艺文·黄梅县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李愬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}